resolveSubway() {
  if (this.flags.subway) return;
  this.flags.subway=true;
  notify...
}
...
```
But tryInteract currently does things. Replace with calls.

`resolvePower()` includes barriers + setTimeout omega.` Interact currently also flash and shake. We'll keep visual in tryInteract? For console destroyed path, effects already from destroy; can include flash in helper? Fine.

Let's use helpers that include notify, subtitle, threat. Visual flash/shake only in tryInteract maybe. For destroyed path, particles from destroy plus helper. okay.

